# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if you want to share your dependency local setups
#   Pipfile.lock might be omitted.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock can be omitted or included.
#   https://python-poetry.org/docs/basic-usage/#commit-your-poetrylock-file-to-version-control
#poetry.lock

